<title>USA: Int'l Game /GTECH may merge - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Int'l Game /GTECH may merge - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slot machine maker International Game Technology may be getting serious about merging with GTECH Holdings Corp, The Wall Street Journal said.</p>
<p>In Tuesday's electronic edition, the Heard on the Street column said some investors say they hope a merger is in the offing.</p>
<p>GTECH stock has been trailing the market since 1993 and is down 10 percent since mid-January, the story said.</p>
<p>The article says &quot;some big investors&quot; now think the only thing standing in the way of a merger is that GTECH management is resisting International Game Technology's advances.</p>
</text>
